1
00:00:06,380 --> 00:00:08,272
=Episode 17=

2
00:00:09,428 --> 00:00:09,809
No.

3
00:00:10,266 --> 00:00:11,866
You must be mistaken.

4
00:00:12,208 --> 00:00:14,037
Jin Yunlie could never be
the Huyun Deity.

5
00:00:14,418 --> 00:00:16,818
He's the Crown Prince of Huyun,
beloved by his people.

6
00:00:16,818 --> 00:00:18,990
You've been deceived by his appearance.

7
00:00:19,103 --> 00:00:19,446
No.

8
00:00:19,942 --> 00:00:21,618
I trust my instincts and my heart.

9
00:00:24,019 --> 00:00:25,314
(I'm from Longyuan Kingdom.)

10
00:00:25,427 --> 00:00:27,104
(I was cast out of Huangyan Kingdom!)

11
00:00:27,141 --> 00:00:28,589
(Xuanhan Kingdom exiled me!)

12
00:00:30,419 --> 00:00:30,989
(Stay behind me.)

13
00:00:33,428 --> 00:00:35,028
He could never be the cruel,

14
00:00:35,028 --> 00:00:36,666
merciless Huyun Deity you speak of.

15
00:00:37,237 --> 00:00:38,304
More importantly,

16
00:00:38,456 --> 00:00:38,990
I love him.

17
00:00:39,789 --> 00:00:41,389
I will never let you kill him.

18
00:00:48,627 --> 00:00:49,541
It's not him?

19
00:00:51,141 --> 00:00:51,980
But

20
00:00:53,122 --> 00:00:54,380
the resemblance is uncanny.

21
00:00:57,390 --> 00:00:58,151
Very well.

22
00:00:59,408 --> 00:01:00,056
Xi Yuan,

23
00:01:00,665 --> 00:01:02,076
I'll trust you this once.

24
00:01:02,990 --> 00:01:04,170
But you should know

25
00:01:04,285 --> 00:01:06,876
I only have enough power
to get you out of here.

26
00:01:07,142 --> 00:01:08,857
I can't save both of you.

27
00:01:09,427 --> 00:01:10,876
I will never abandon him.

28
00:01:11,828 --> 00:01:12,590
Just as

29
00:01:13,237 --> 00:01:14,685
he would never abandon me.

30
00:01:17,200 --> 00:01:17,961
Jin Yunlie,

31
00:01:18,838 --> 00:01:19,866
I'm coming to save you.

32
00:01:25,122 --> 00:01:26,457
That's the Phoenix Primordial Flame!

33
00:01:32,551 --> 00:01:33,314
Xi Yuan.

34
00:01:37,542 --> 00:01:38,189
Xi Yuan, get out of here!

35
00:01:38,189 --> 00:01:38,951
Leave me!

36
00:01:40,057 --> 00:01:40,933
Don't talk nonsense.

37
00:01:41,428 --> 00:01:42,457
How could I ever leave you behind?

38
00:01:43,370 --> 00:01:43,866
Just a moment.

39
00:01:44,209 --> 00:01:45,465
Just a moment longer.

40
00:01:51,638 --> 00:01:53,733
So what if you wield
the Phoenix Primordial Flame?

41
00:01:53,770 --> 00:01:54,152
Today,

42
00:01:54,532 --> 00:01:55,865
no one can stop me.

43
00:02:04,170 --> 00:02:04,665
Xi Yuan!

44
00:02:05,618 --> 00:02:06,114
Xi Yuan!

45
00:02:07,180 --> 00:02:07,865
Jin Yunlie...

46
00:02:32,057 --> 00:02:32,703
Gu Diao,

47
00:02:33,656 --> 00:02:34,760
I'll kill you!

48
00:02:43,027 --> 00:02:43,599
Madman!

49
00:02:43,865 --> 00:02:44,780
You've truly gone mad!

50
00:02:45,047 --> 00:02:46,266
You've actually fallen into
to demonic corruption.

51
00:02:49,123 --> 00:02:51,218
I once suppressed your master.

52
00:02:51,714 --> 00:02:53,122
Today, I can kill you too.

53
00:02:58,989 --> 00:02:59,714
Jin Yunlie,

54
00:03:00,437 --> 00:03:01,238
don't try anything,

55
00:03:01,733 --> 00:03:02,760
or I'll kill her.

56
00:03:18,684 --> 00:03:18,951
Gu Diao,

57
00:03:19,447 --> 00:03:19,980
now!

58
00:03:21,504 --> 00:03:22,419
Reversal of Heaven and Earth!

59
00:03:24,742 --> 00:03:26,380
Jin Yunlie!

60
00:03:34,114 --> 00:03:35,104
Die!

61
00:03:43,332 --> 00:03:44,132
Jin Yunlie,

62
00:03:44,857 --> 00:03:46,875
in the end, you still died by my hand.

63
00:03:59,103 --> 00:03:59,714
Jin Yunlie,

64
00:04:00,285 --> 00:04:01,122
wake up! Please!

65
00:04:01,238 --> 00:04:02,990
I'm here! I'm here!

66
00:04:03,065 --> 00:04:04,476
I've come to save you.

67
00:04:04,780 --> 00:04:05,542
Jin Yunlie!

68
00:04:06,076 --> 00:04:06,837
Jin Yunlie...

69
00:04:07,866 --> 00:04:09,275
Jin Yunlie, please, wake up!

70
00:04:09,961 --> 00:04:10,342
I...

71
00:04:11,141 --> 00:04:11,599
I...

72
00:04:11,789 --> 00:04:13,123
I've come to save you.

73
00:04:13,123 --> 00:04:14,152
I'm here to save you.

74
00:04:17,275 --> 00:04:18,114
Wake up...

75
00:04:25,351 --> 00:04:26,114
Jin Yunlie,

76
00:04:26,990 --> 00:04:27,751
wake up.

77
00:04:28,438 --> 00:04:30,646
Jin Yunlie, don't scare me like this.

78
00:04:38,456 --> 00:04:39,447
Jin Yunlie...

79
00:04:41,084 --> 00:04:43,142
Jin Yunlie, you can't die!

80
00:04:44,742 --> 00:04:46,265
Don't die!

81
00:04:47,141 --> 00:04:49,160
Please, don't die!

82
00:05:00,323 --> 00:05:01,084
Jin Yunlie,

83
00:05:02,456 --> 00:05:04,360
don't leave me behind.

84
00:05:05,390 --> 00:05:06,799
Don't go...

85
00:05:12,513 --> 00:05:13,884
No!

86
00:05:26,303 --> 00:05:28,284
Jin Yunlie...

87
00:05:49,619 --> 00:05:51,027
You have come at last.

88
00:05:54,723 --> 00:05:55,676
Phoenix Deity,

89
00:05:56,057 --> 00:05:56,933
you're a deity.

90
00:05:57,503 --> 00:05:58,799
Please, save him. I beg you.

91
00:05:59,180 --> 00:06:00,551
Please, save him!

92
00:06:01,503 --> 00:06:02,190
It's useless.

93
00:06:02,684 --> 00:06:03,941
He's already dead.

94
00:06:04,284 --> 00:06:06,418
His soul is probably already
at the River of Oblivion.

95
00:06:07,638 --> 00:06:08,438
The River of Oblivion?

96
00:06:09,884 --> 00:06:11,027
Then I'll go there and find him!

97
00:06:14,341 --> 00:06:16,741
You're still in a mortal body.

98
00:06:16,856 --> 00:06:19,408
You can't withstand
the Death Energy of the Netherworld.

99
00:06:20,170 --> 00:06:21,047
Unless...

100
00:06:21,390 --> 00:06:22,304
Unless what?

101
00:06:22,494 --> 00:06:23,142
Unless

102
00:06:24,247 --> 00:06:26,457
you can rebuild your phoenix form

103
00:06:27,066 --> 00:06:28,932
and obtain the power
of rebirth through nirvana.

104
00:06:29,390 --> 00:06:29,999
At that point,

105
00:06:30,266 --> 00:06:32,171
the Life Energy you can wield

106
00:06:32,171 --> 00:06:35,142
will counter all
Demonic Energy and Death Energy.

107
00:06:37,657 --> 00:06:38,419
Nirvana...

108
00:06:41,695 --> 00:06:43,600
You don't have much time left.

109
00:06:43,904 --> 00:06:45,541
Have you made your decision?

110
00:06:49,428 --> 00:06:50,380
I'm willing to undergo nirvana.

111
00:07:25,770 --> 00:07:26,533
Nirvana

112
00:07:27,485 --> 00:07:29,122
means reliving

113
00:07:29,428 --> 00:07:31,333
your most agonizing memories of death

114
00:07:31,333 --> 00:07:32,513
thousands of times.

115
00:07:32,513 --> 00:07:34,113
Only by enduring it all

116
00:07:34,304 --> 00:07:36,590
can you become
the true immortal phoenix.

117
00:08:00,400 --> 00:08:03,332
So she couldn't make it after all?

118
00:08:14,456 --> 00:08:15,942
How did she suddenly die?

119
00:08:17,199 --> 00:08:18,989
How am I supposed to report this
to the Great Demon Lord now?

120
00:08:21,618 --> 00:08:22,380
That's...

121
00:08:25,619 --> 00:08:27,560
How can there be
a remnant soul inside her body?

122
00:08:32,628 --> 00:08:33,541
Trying to flee?

123
00:08:34,190 --> 00:08:34,990
Not a chance.

124
00:08:41,085 --> 00:08:41,542
Xi Yuan,

125
00:08:42,190 --> 00:08:43,408
I can only stall him for a moment.

126
00:08:43,751 --> 00:08:45,313
You have to make it through nirvana.

127
00:08:59,865 --> 00:09:00,628
Xi Yuan,

128
00:09:01,428 --> 00:09:02,951
you have to hold on.

129
00:09:09,122 --> 00:09:09,732
How could

130
00:09:10,075 --> 00:09:11,980
a fragment of his divine sense be here?

131
00:09:15,294 --> 00:09:16,056
Xi Yuan.

132
00:09:17,008 --> 00:09:17,771
Xi Yuan?

133
00:09:18,495 --> 00:09:19,256
Wake up.

134
00:09:21,428 --> 00:09:22,190
Wake up.

135
00:09:24,932 --> 00:09:25,694
Jin Yunlie?

136
00:09:28,095 --> 00:09:28,857
Jin Yunlie,

137
00:09:30,266 --> 00:09:31,714
aren't you already dead?

138
00:09:32,246 --> 00:09:33,275
Why are you here?

139
00:09:33,275 --> 00:09:34,647
I really am dead.

140
00:09:35,560 --> 00:09:36,704
What you see now

141
00:09:36,856 --> 00:09:37,922
is a fragment of my divine sense

142
00:09:38,114 --> 00:09:40,285
I left inside you
during the Martial Trial.

143
00:09:45,961 --> 00:09:46,722
Jin Yunlie,

144
00:09:47,371 --> 00:09:48,819
can you please stay?

145
00:09:48,971 --> 00:09:50,723
Can you stay with me a little longer?

146
00:09:52,857 --> 00:09:54,113
I want to stay with you too.

147
00:09:54,647 --> 00:09:55,523
But I believe

148
00:09:56,246 --> 00:09:57,237
that even without me,

149
00:09:57,390 --> 00:09:58,913
you can keep living, and live well.

150
00:09:59,713 --> 00:10:00,476
So,

151
00:10:00,665 --> 00:10:01,160
for me,

152
00:10:02,419 --> 00:10:03,828
please don't give up.

153
00:10:05,884 --> 00:10:06,685
Jin Yunlie!

154
00:10:06,989 --> 00:10:07,523
No!

155
00:10:10,752 --> 00:10:16,620
♪A love letter, a passionate pursuit,
the envy of everyone♪

156
00:10:17,800 --> 00:10:23,136
♪Bouquets and heartfelt confessions,
leaving me moved and fulfilled♪

157
00:10:24,400 --> 00:10:30,040
♪No matter how long or hard our road,
I don't care♪

158
00:10:30,330 --> 00:10:36,976
♪But you left me with this pain,
forever beyond redemption♪
